{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minesweeper, Reimagined\uff01 Experience original Big Bomb Mode + classic minesweeper gameplay, offering dual logic deduction experiences! Enjoy quirky power-ups and collect various skins/achievements! Try it now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707010/extras/96211aa54570b324e6a184c37aea6f3b.avif?t=1761793013\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707010/extras_big/96211aa54570b324e6a184c37aea6f3b.avif?t=1761793013 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember that mysterious Minesweeper on your old computer?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s back\u2026 and this time, it brought a BIG BOMB!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Minesweeper: Big Bomb, you\u2019ll still flip tiles and use numbers to deduce where the mines are hiding. But wait\u2014this time, it\u2019s not just about tiptoeing around danger. You\u2019ll also decide when to unleash the Big Bomb and blow everything sky high!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you play it safe? Or gamble it all in one fiery blast? The choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Big Bomb Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brand-new twist\u2014stop tiptoeing, start detonating! Decide the perfect moment to trigger the Big Boom and ignite all the mines.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707010/extras/192bc58e22b23742decda38e94f1a3a2.poster.avif?t=1761793013\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707010/extras/192bc58e22b23742decda38e94f1a3a2.webm?t=1761793013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707010/extras/192bc58e22b23742decda38e94f1a3a2.mp4?t=1761793013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Classic Nostalgia</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the old-school fans: the traditional number-crunching puzzle you know and love is still here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707010/extras/ef58a27d5e28c5f9c1e48104686ac901.poster.avif?t=1761793013\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707010/extras/ef58a27d5e28c5f9c1e48104686ac901.webm?t=1761793013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707010/extras/ef58a27d5e28c5f9c1e48104686ac901.mp4?t=1761793013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Difficulty Levels</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From casual tile-flipping to hardcore brain-melting challenges, pick your poison.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707010/extras/bf25778ea9c8b8d5ce9f92742219eb50.poster.avif?t=1761793013\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707010/extras/bf25778ea9c8b8d5ce9f92742219eb50.webm?t=1761793013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707010/extras/bf25778ea9c8b8d5ce9f92742219eb50.mp4?t=1761793013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Skins &amp; Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What does your bomb look 